<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31725" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβῐ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to force out, dislodge, expel,</i> prob.
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βιβάζω</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.243d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				662a
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρα κατά τινος</span>
			<i>lay violent</i> hands on, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				40.1
			</span></i> (s.v.l.):—elsewh. in 
				Med.
			 (fut. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιάσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Pk.</u>
					252
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.340.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.23.4
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.584e
				</span></i>
			 :— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον χειρῶν
			ἐκβεβιασμένον</span> the bow <i>forced from</i> mine hands,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1129
			</span></i>(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβιασθέντες</span>”
				<i>forced from their position,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.28.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, etc.: rare in pres., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐκβιαζομένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>constrain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				2.3.4
			</span></i> : c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ ὑπακοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.2.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ γράφειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.216
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτους ἀνελεῖν -βιασθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					40.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>project with force,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				800b12
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>exploit to the full,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τόλμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.258D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>press upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐκβιάσηται τὰ σπλάγχνα [ἡ
					ὑστέρη]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be expressed in a forced, elaborate way,</i> of
			works of art, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in argument,
				<i>insist,</i> c. acc. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.74
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
